<report>
<title>Number needed to treat (empirical results using observed counts only)</title>

<p><ci>Estimates with @{pc:round2}% confidence intervals:</ci></p>

<p>Risk of event in controls = @ce <ci>(@{ce_from:roundu} to @ce_to)</ci><br />
Risk of event in treated = @te <ci>(@{te_from:roundu} to @te_to)</ci><br />
Relative risk of event = @{rre:roundu} <ci>(@{rre_from:roundu} to @{rre_to:roundu})</ci></p>

<p>Risk of no event in controls = @cne <ci>(@{cne_from:roundu} to @cne_to)</ci><br />
Risk of no event in treated = @tne <ci>(@{tne_from:roundu} to @tne_to)</ci><br />
Relative risk of no event = @{rrne:roundu} <ci>(@{rrne_from:roundu} to @{rrne_to:roundu})</ci></p>

<p>Odds ratio of event in treated cf. controls = @{oor:roundu} <ci>(@{oor_from:roundu} to @{oor_to:roundu})</ci><br />
Relative risk reduction (controls-treated) = @{rrr:roundu} <ci>(@{rrr_from:roundu} to @{rrr_to:roundu})</ci><br />
Risk difference (controls-treated) = @{rd:roundu} <ci>(@{rd_from:roundu} to @{rd_to:roundu})</ci></p>

<p>NNT [risk difference] = @treat <ci>(@treat_from to @treat_to)</ci><br />
<b>NNT [risk difference] (rounded up) = @treat_round <ci>(@treat_round_from to @treat_round_to) </ci></b></p>

<block name="adjusted">
<br />
<title>Needed to treat (adjusted for baseline/expected risk)</title>

<p>Expected risk of event without treatment @type= @{brr:round2}%</p>

<p><ci>Estimates with @{pc:round2}% confidence intervals:</ci></p>

<p>NNT [risk difference] = @rd_treat <ci>(@rd_treat_from to @rd_treat_to)</ci><br />
<b>NNT [risk difference] (rounded up) = @rd_treat_round <ci>(@rd_treat_round_from to @rd_treat_round_to)</ci></b></p>

<p>NNT [relative risk of event] = @rr_treat <ci>(@rr_treat_from to @rr_treat_to)</ci><br />
<b>NNT [relative risk of event] (rounded up) = @rr_treat_round <ci>(@rr_treat_round_from to @rr_treat_round_to)</ci></b></p>

<p>NNT [relative risk of no event] = @rrn_treat <ci>(@rrn_treat_from to @rrn_treat_to)</ci><br />
<b>NNT [relative risk of no event] (rounded up) = @rrn_treat_round <ci>(@rrn_treat_round_from to @rrn_treat_round_to)</ci></b></p>

<p>NNT [odds ratio] = @or_treat <ci>(@or_treat_from to @or_treat_to)</ci><br />
<b>NNT [odds ratio] (rounded up) = @or_treat_round <ci>(@or_treat_round_from to @or_treat_round_to)</ci></b></p>

</block>
<br />
</report>
